From: Onigiri
Subject: [PATCH] Add High performance toggle

A switch under Onigiri settings stores the choice in persist.sys.onigiri.overclocking, which the
b5q thermal patch reads when Samsung Device Health loads its policy. It shows only where that
policy is siop_b5q_sm8550, and each saved change offers a restart.

